+### Step 1: Complexity Analysis
+- Naive: all subarrays = O(n²), find max = O(n) → **O(n³) - TOO SLOW**
+- Better: precompute, count contributions of each element
+- Target: **O(n²)** or better
+
+### Step 2: Brute-Force (brute.py)
+```python
